Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec | policykit-1, iproute2, systemd
Recommends: avahi-utils, network-manager
Description: keep local devices on the physical network instead of a VPN
 Lan Route Fixer discovers local devices and lets users select which private
 IPv4/IPv6 destinations should stay on a physical LAN interface. It provides a
 GTK4 interface, a command-line mode, automatic monitoring, and a validated
 PolicyKit helper for privileged route changes.
